  "scope": "For any compact A in the real (mu, theta) parameter plane and any fixed z>0, one common constructed positive annulus carries a classical inverse family with fixed endpoint normalization, uniform norm/source/parameter estimates, real analyticity and source-independent uniform bounds for every order of actual parameter derivatives. A prescribed larger matching annulus and the manuscript weighted overlap/residual estimates remain open."
